    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The tolling of the iron bell rings out into the ether, summoning a mysterious entity only known as "
        },
        {
          "text": "The Broker",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This entity will remain for one half day and will trade a combination of faction tokens obtained by defeating faction troops in addition to relics of my own faction in exchange for relics it has somehow obtained from the other factions. \n\nI should ensure that I have one of each of my faction's relics available for trade and at least a stack of each of the faction tokens before calling upon The Broker.\n\nIt's anyone's guess what use it has for the marks."
        }
      ]
    }
